.claude/state/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
lean/.lake/
.ledger-outbox
transcripts/

# API keys for the orchestrator only; never committed
.env.*

# Claude Code's per-user permission rules ("don't ask again" writes them): never committed, never carried with a copy
# of the tree; RULES.md section 9, settings are templates, never live
.claude/settings.local.json

# A third-party source an instance clones for reading (its own .git): pin it by commit in the problem's
# prior-art register, ignore it here, and name its prefix in .verify-data-skip. One line per clone.

# Method change 25: what a networked worker downloads is hashed in RUN/RECORD-EXT.md, not committed
workspace-*/runs/*/downloads/
